Both 0result.sql and 2result.sql arrive at the right numbers, but 1result.sql is the cleanest and most explicit:

• It tags each UNION branch with an integer literal (2013‑2016), avoiding the later CAST that 0result.sql needs.  
• It keeps the date filter with simple EXTRACT logic, so no string manipulation is required (unlike 2result.sql’s FORMAT_DATE).  
• It already excludes NULL values and bad‑flag rows, making the intent crystal‑clear.

Hence 1result.sql is the best choice.

